---
import Public from '../layouts/Public.astro';
import { clientRelease } from '../data/public-content';
const clientUrl = clientRelease.fullClient.url;
---
<Public title="Download">
  <section class="panel center">
    <h1 class="title">Download</h1>
    <p>Full client · WYD {clientRelease.fullClient.clientVersion} · Windows</p>
    {clientUrl
      ? <p><a class="button" href={clientUrl} rel="noopener noreferrer">Download client</a></p>
      : <p class="status" role="status">The client is not available yet.</p>}
    <p>Full installation: {clientRelease.fullClient.clientVersion}. Download from Google Drive. Keep the adapted native launcher for subsequent updates, starting at 7.48.101.</p>
    <p lang="pt-BR">Instalação completa: {clientRelease.fullClient.clientVersion}. Baixe pelo Google Drive. Mantenha o launcher nativo adaptado para os próximos updates, a partir de 7.48.101.</p>
    <p>The adapted native launcher downloads updates through HTTPS and validates the server certificate.</p>
    <p lang="pt-BR">O launcher nativo adaptado baixa as atualizações por HTTPS e valida o certificado do servidor.</p>
    <p>The server requires baseline 7.48.100. Older installations must download the new full client. Do not apply older manual patches to this baseline.</p>
    <p lang="pt-BR">O servidor exige a base 7.48.100. Instalações anteriores precisam baixar o novo cliente completo. Não aplique patches manuais antigos sobre esta base.</p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li>Extract the client into a folder you can write to.</li>
      <li>Run <strong>WYDLauncher.exe</strong>. The native launcher installs game updates before <strong>Start</strong>.</li>
      <li>Use <strong>Settings</strong> in the native launcher for resolution and window mode.</li>
    </ol>
    <p lang="pt-BR">Extraia em uma pasta com permissão de escrita e abra WYDLauncher.exe. Use Settings para escolher resolução e modo de janela.</p>
    <p class="links"><a href="/play/getting-started/">Installation guide</a> · <a href="/play/faq/">Help</a></p>
    <details class="disclosure prose">
    <summary>Client {clientRelease.fullClient.clientVersion} · Details</summary>
    <dl class="details"><dt>Version</dt><dd>{clientRelease.fullClient.clientVersion}</dd><dt>Game language</dt><dd>English or Brazilian Portuguese, selected in the launcher</dd></dl>
    <p>Clients from before 7.48.001 must download the new full client. Earlier patches are no longer offered. Keep the full installation and let the launcher install every newer update.</p>
    <p>Every client update is mandatory. The server checks the game build; changing the version counter does not make an old executable compatible.</p>
    <p><a href="/client-manifest.json">Versioned download receipt (JSON)</a></p>
    {clientRelease.fullClient.sha256 && <p class="muted">Full client / Cliente completo: {clientRelease.fullClient.sizeBytes} bytes · SHA-256: <code>{clientRelease.fullClient.sha256}</code></p>}
    </details>
    <details class="disclosure prose"><summary>Repair an installation</summary>
      <p>Close the game. Extract the full client into a new writable folder, then run its launcher. Keep all asset folders together.</p>
      <p>Do not edit the version counter, mix client files or disable antivirus protection.</p>
    </details>
  </section>
</Public>
